  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leadership Opportunities for Young Salvadorans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Pro-Bsqueda de Nias y Nios Desaparecidos (Pro-Bsqueda) will work with young Salvadorans in 10 departments who face high levels of violence and poverty to develop their leadership and civic engagement skills promote conflict resolution in their communities and raise awareness on human rights. Pro-Bsqueda&apos;s activities focus on a new generation of people living with the legacy of the civil war and concurrently coping with the impact of the present cycle of violence in the country. Pro-Bsqueda will assess the conditions that affect young family members of disappeared as well as their psycho-social needs. Program activities also include support for their economic initiatives. The Grant will directly benefit 141 young adults affected by disappearances from the civil war and by current violence and will indirectly benefit at least 705 Salvadorans.</narrative>
  </description>
